  "title": "Marsala Pork Chop Sandwich with Hot and Sweet Dipping Sauce",
  "description": "Pork marinated in a marsala-honey sauce is simmered and served on a roll alongside a sweet and spicy sauce in this pork chop sandwich recipe.",
